# Hub Setup Wizard portable Node/Python — must live under Archipelago's
# custom_worlds/, NOT inside this world repo. Nesting them here bloated
# packs to ~7k files / ~80MB+ (node.exe, CPython, .pdbs, site-packages).
custom_worlds/
**/_metroid_bread_runtime/
**/_metroid_dread_runtime/
**/tools/node-*/
**/tools/python-*/
*.pdb

